*
* ---------------------------------------------------------------------- interaction nodes (FV) and checks
* INTGEN,<type>: 0 clear, 1 FV, 2 FI-EVBN, 3 FI-FSIN, 5 FFV (types add up).  Model 1: FV, every
* node of the excavated volume (405 nodes).
INTGEN,1
INTCOUNT
* the model checks the manual strongly recommends before production runs; CALCM: the building
